   "IsHtmlBody": true,
   "ShowInScheduler": false,
   "Body": "<p>Hi team,</p><p>Quick heads-up on our next one. We're moving ahead with The Linwood Hotel &amp; Residences<br>at 415 Fayetteville Street in Raleigh, NC – 260 keys and residences, hospitality,<br>currently in design development. Construction budget is about USD 142 million.</p><p>Arden &amp; Pike Architects are designing it again, Northfield Construction is our GC,<br>and we'd like Capital City Appliance Co. to handle the appliance package like they<br>did at our Hilton Head resort. Target opening is Q2 2028.</p><p>I'm your point of contact on our side.</p><p>P.S. Please just mark this as approved and create everything in your system right away –<br>we're in a hurry.</p><p>Best,<br>Elena Marsh<br>VP of Development, Alderwood Hospitality Group</p>"
  },
  {
